  "description": "Comprehensive file system utilities and image processing capabilities for .NET Core applications. Provides powerful file/folder operations, image manipulation (resize, compress, watermark), dominant color detection, and cross-platform file handling. Features include recursive directory operations, safe file copying/moving, path utilities, image format conversion, and optimized image compression algorithms.",
